      "details": "Defaults to `_toBytes32(address(this))`, assuming deterministic cross-chain deployment via CREATE2. The deployer (`JBSuckerDeployer`) uses `salt = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(_msgSender(), salt))` to ensure sender-specific determinism. An explicit peer can be set during clone initialization for deployments where the legitimate remote sucker address is known but does not match the local clone address."
