      "notice": "Adds a buyback hook implementation to the allowlist so projects can select it.",
      "details": "Only the owner can allow a hook.Allowing address(0) lets authorized operators clear a project's hook assignment via setHookFor, returning it to the default hook. This is the intended way to \"unset\" a project-specific hook.",
