      "details": "Only the project's owner or an address with the `JBPermissionIds.SET_BUYBACK_HOOK` permission from the owner can lock a hook for a project.Atomic set-and-lock (calling setHookFor then lockHookFor in one transaction) lets trusted operators configure and finalize hook settings in a single transaction, reducing the window for front-running or configuration changes between set and lock.",
